<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Williams-Sonoma started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Williams-Sonoma started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it began coverage of Williams-Sonoma Inc with ratings of market perform for the intermediate term and outperform for the long-term.</p>
<p>--&quot;While recent sales performance and near-term prospects at Williams-Sonoma are excellent, the stock appears to be already discounting considerable continued success for the company,&quot; EVEREN said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Williams-Sonoma shares were down 1/8 at 35-1/8.</p>
<p>-- &quot;While we are attracted to the good fundamentals of Williams-Sonoma, we would prefer to own it at a better valuation,&quot; EVEREN said.</p>
<p>-- The six-month target price is $35 a share and the 18-month target is $42.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
